<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_6342abf554836b9d5e4fb95b38d26c5f98a3ab831ae1050feca2b48a189a459c_n0007/na_0012> <http://digistrucmed.org/notes> "Lead reconnection is the alternative necessary action." .
